CHAPTER.VERS:
Therefore say thou unto them, Thus saith the LORD of hosts; 

          Let your fruits declare that you are God's people, and that he has wrought in you by his Spirit, and mortified you: for otherwise man has no power to return to God, but God must convert him; (Jer_31:18; Lam_5:21) {{See Isa_31:6}}
         Turn ye unto me, saith the LORD of hosts, and I will turn unto you, saith the LORD of hosts.
